0..81 Comment "// A product of two sums over free naturals has one normal form, however it sums."
82..84 Comment "//"
85..163 Comment "// Grégoire and Leroy normalise the product of 128 plus `x` and 128 plus `y`."
164..229 Comment "// Its free variables leave matches stuck inside the normal form."
230..232 Comment "//"
233..314 Comment "// Each factor runs sixteen successors past a free variable, so the product stops"
315..394 Comment "// on matches over `x` and `y`. Two definitions hold the products, and the path"
395..419 Comment "// compares their calls."
420..422 Comment "//"
423..502 Comment "// - see: Grégoire and Leroy, _A compiled implementation of strong reduction_,"
503..523 Comment "//   ICFP 2002, § 6"
524..596 Comment "// - see: #3314 — the same products written in the path do not convert"
597..634 Comment "// - see: #2282 — the benchmark set"
636..676 Comment "// The free naturals and their addition."
